    "created_at": "2015-12-12T05:27:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-12T05:27:09Z",
    "body": "CanvasImageSmoothing and CanvasDrawImageMethods should be one IMHO, but that breaks the order of things in the IDL, which @bzbarsky warned against. I wonder to what extent we want to allow order preservation concerns to constrain how we group things.\n\nAlso, I think CanvasDrawingStyles should be divided into two sub-interfaces: PathDrawingStyles and TextDrawingStyles\n\nI think the \"drawing state\" concept (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#drawing-state) will need to be redefined (maybe in a future change) in a way that will allow the definition to apply to interfaces that implement subsets of CRC2D.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
