    "body": "@junov Splitting `CanvasDrawingStyles` isn't a clear cut as `addPathByStrokingText()` and `addText()` methods take this object assuming both Path and Text styles. I could add a another interface which implements both `PathDrawingStyles` and `TextDrawingStyles` but seems like overkill?\n\n@junov `CanvasImageSmoothing` is also used in the spec for fill/stroke styles for patterns.\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#fill-and-stroke-styles:dom-context-2d-imagesmoothingenabled\nBelongs in separate because of that?\n\n@annevk Added note about enumeration order below IDL def.\n\n@domenic Merged & renamed commit.\n",
