    "body": "@junov Added additional `CanvasDrawingStyles` interface which implements `CanvasPathDrawingStyles` and `CanvasTextDrawingStyles`. PTAL.\n\n`CanvasState` at the moment, just contains the `save()` and `restore()` functions. \nIf we were to add the state attributes into the that interface it would mean that `OffscreenRenderingContext2D` would need to implement text states, etc.\n\nIt would also mean that `CanvasDrawingStyles` could not be split out and used for the `DrawingStyle` interface.\n\nI can add into this PR the concept of each interface adding properties on the \"Drawing State\". I.e.\n\n\"\"\"\"\n_The canvas state_\nEach object implementing the `CanvasState` interface maintains a stack of drawing states. Other interfaces (for example the `CanvasTextDrawingStyles` interface) add properties to the \"Drawing State\" to be saved/restored.\n\n_Line Styles_\nThe following attributes which exist on the `CanvasTextDrawingStyles` interface should be added to the list of properties on the \"Drawing State\".\n- lineWidth\n- lineCap\n- ...\n\n\"\"\"\"\n\nThoughts?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
